# L §2.4 Values, §8.3 LOAD-PRECISION (tally 2.1.7 R9, issue #148; G9): a band row's bare figure finer than its
# minor unit prints as written, `2.005`. 2.1.6's refcore printed the fraction `401/200`.
=== g9.tally
model g9
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "made up"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input amt: money PLN

band fee(x: money PLN): money PLN

ask q: fee(amt)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 4.00 PLN "the card"
  fee: [0, 3.01) = 2.005 "the card"
  fee: [3.01, inf) = 3.00 PLN "the card"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PRECISION 2.005 is finer than the minor unit ...
